    <!-- cassette: warm-grey chassis secondaries. The web renders its base ramp
         at full chroma (classic skin = identity), but the web keeps its chrome
         on the low, near-neutral steps. Android's Material elevated surfaces
         (bottom nav = surfaceContainer, nav pill = secondaryContainer) climb to
         the mid steps, where the ramp's chroma widens and reads BROWN. So the
         Android tonal ramp is de-saturated (~35% of the base warmth kept) to
         match the warm-grey web/iOS chrome — accent still carries the colour. -->
    <color name="md_theme_dark_secondary">#B7B1A6</color>
    <color name="md_theme_dark_onSecondary">#23201A</color>
